<title>TURKEY: Turkey says Iraqi oil line can pump 1.5 mln bpd.</title>
<headline>Turkey says Iraqi oil line can pump 1.5 mln bpd.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A trans-Turkey twin pipeline from Iraq's Kirkuk oilfields to Turkey's southern Ceyhan terminal can handle Iraqi exports of 1.5 million barrels per day under a second oil-for-food accord between Baghdad and the United Nations, a Turkish pipeline official said on Friday.</p>
</text>
